{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21966","headline":"村居苦寒 · 白居易","name":"村居苦寒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八年十二月，五日雪纷纷。\n竹柏皆冻死，况彼无衣民。\n回观村闾间，十室八九贫。\n北风利如劒，布絮不蔽身。\n唯烧蒿棘火，愁坐夜待晨。\n乃知大寒岁，农者尤苦辛。\n顾我当此日，草堂深掩门。\n褐裘覆絁被，坐卧有余温。\n幸免饥冻苦，又无壠亩勤。\n念彼深可媿，自问是何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}